    "v7.10.20: PUSH YOUR EXISTING BACKLOG TO GITHUB [task 733af05f]. "
    "scan_active_tasks and push_task_creation existed but nothing swept the "
    "pre-existing backlog: POST /api/integrations/connect/{provider}/"
