    "v7.1.13: SMOOTH STORY/PLAN GATES [owner 2026-07-19, cold-drive findings]. "
    "(1) The story_complete rubric now accepts an AC written as a PLAIN line "
    "('AC-1: … Oracle: …'), not only a markdown bullet — a naive author no "
