    "v6.5.8: PREVENT the embedding-path deadlock at the SOURCE so the "
    "out-of-process supervisor (v6.5.7) is genuine last-resort (GH #162, task "
    "76cdb309). Root cause: a thread holding the GIL while blocked on a native "
    "futex waiting on BLAS/OpenMP worker threads on the embed path (model2vec "
    "-> numpy/OpenBLAS), compounded by torch's 2nd OpenMP runtime (libgomp) — "
    "two native-math runtimes in one process is threadpoolctl's documented "
    "unrecoverable deadlock case. Three structural fixes: (1) AUTHORITATIVE "
    "runtime pin — brain_engine._threadpool_limit_1() now wraps the model LOAD "
    "(_load_model2vec/_load_sentence_transformer under _MODEL_LOCK) in addition "
