    "threadpoolctl.threadpool_limits(1) OVERRIDES a pre-set OPENBLAS_NUM_THREADS"
    "=8 and is import-order-proof, unlike thread_limits.apply_thread_limits()'s "
    "if-unset/before-import env pins. threadpoolctl is now a DECLARED runtime "
    "dependency (pyproject.toml), no longer an optional try/except. (2) ONE math "
    "runtime by default — torch + sentence-transformers MOVED out of core deps "
    "into a [neural] optional extra; the default model2vec/potion path is "
    "numpy-only and never imports torch ('torch' not in sys.modules after a "
