    "\n\n7.13.77: CORRECTING 7.13.76's own claim that the OTHER 2 CI "
    "failures on PR #2344 (test_control_plane_pinned.py::"
    "test_gate_still_refuses_a_genuine_conflict_resolution_edit, "
